(4,'Numbers',7,78,'On the twelfth day Ahira the son of Enan, leader of the children of Naphtali, presented an offering.'),
(4,'Numbers',7,79,'And his offering was one silver charger, the weight of which was one hundred and thirty shekels, one silver bowl of seventy shekels, after the shekel of the sanctuary, both of them full of fine flour mixed with oil as a grain offering;'),
